    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the Maze Adventure game, where everyone is invited to test their determination as they venture through a series of challenges. Navigate through a diverse cast of characters, each possessing unique abilities. How far will you progress? Capture a screenshot and showcase your accomplishments, revealing the level you've reached. Ultimately, we hope you enjoy the exhilarating race to the finish before time runs out!",
